Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Follow the Sony remote in the Sony Bravia Infrared media
 player

When an infrared receiver is configured, the event entity passes each key
on to the media player. Power on, power off and the power toggle update
the assumed power state, and TV and HDMI 1 to 4 set the source. Input
cycling keys clear the source, since the new input can't be known.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
